{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547920/extras/8655665ccee2bcefa2160fc0f68b1941.avif?t=1773869436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547920/extras_big/8655665ccee2bcefa2160fc0f68b1941.avif?t=1773869436 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qualifications? Work Experience? Nonsense, this job is simple. With our state of the art training system, you'll be a package inspecting pro in no time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Delivers is a Night based, Survival Horror game with Investigation Elements where you take on the role of Package Inspector at Postal Sector 7. Throughout the night, you are tasked with completing your quota by successfully assessing packages. You should also simultaneously check your surroundings for any unforeseen workplace dangers to ensure you live long enough to see the next workday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547920/extras/b1e37e6ffbae157befa20ab688826f4c.avif?t=1773869436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547920/extras_big/b1e37e6ffbae157befa20ab688826f4c.avif?t=1773869436 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547920/extras/c543a2a73cb51c1cf4c3d52314765863.poster.avif?t=1773869436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547920/extras/c543a2a73cb51c1cf4c3d52314765863.webm?t=1773869436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams